      "requested_repair": "In a fresh authorized attempt, preserve this frozen delivery and all inherited records/registry identities. Add one new stable nested context component for the entire visible upper black arrow beside B, with its exact parent, box and fresh source-derived crop/text/image evidence. Record visual position without inventing a legal target or semantics. Update the complete region/component ledgers, inventory/registry, source pins, inspection sheets, coverage/continuation endpoint indices, reports and delivery manifest consistently. Do not alter inventory parent boxes or increase the task/full inventory denominator.",
      "repair_validation": [
        "Independently inspect the new crop against original physical page 28 and verify the whole visible arrow is retained. Recheck every component in the affected second diagram and retain prior complete page/ledger review coverage.",
        "For a single-component addition, expect 87 new nested components, 189 new total targets, 92 full context regions and 941 total region records; assigned inventory remains 100 and full inventory remains 849. Retain all previous IDs and evidence byte pins.",
        "Run two separate complete serial replays for the revised complete target/component sets, not only the new crop. Recheck stable identities, exact inherited preservation, normalized output equality and zero component/context denominator contribution.",
        "Rerun source inventory validation, unchanged tests/sources, scripts/check.ps1 -Task IG-2B07 and git diff --check with the permitted exact-command approval path where required. Freeze a new delivery for independent rereview."
      ]
